WEBVTT

00:00:07.998 --> 00:00:10.000
(echoing):
Hello?

00:00:15.798 --> 00:00:16.924
Aw.

00:00:17.007 --> 00:00:18.300
Poor guys.

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.970
I know what it's like to feel abandoned.

00:00:26.976 --> 00:00:28.144
Don't worry.

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:30.521
You're not alone anymore.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.483
(grunting)

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:44.410
(gasps)

00:00:47.788 --> 00:00:49.790
(grunting)

00:00:55.546 --> 00:00:58.007
(whining)

00:00:58.090 --> 00:00:59.717
(whimpering loudly)

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.386
(grunting)

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:04.305
There you go.

00:01:04.388 --> 00:01:06.015
(panting)

00:01:06.098 --> 00:01:08.267
(grunting)

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:10.144
(panting heavily)

00:01:10.227 --> 00:01:11.771
Okay, okay.

00:01:11.854 --> 00:01:13.439
I'm okay. I'm okay.

00:01:13.522 --> 00:01:14.982
(sighs)

00:01:15.065 --> 00:01:16.358
(grunts)

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:17.860
(yells)

00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:19.111
Stay here. Stay here.

00:01:19.195 --> 00:01:21.155
And you, you take care
of your brother, now.

00:01:21.238 --> 00:01:22.948
Mama's gonna be right back.

00:01:23.032 --> 00:01:24.992
Mama's coming, baby!

00:01:25.075 --> 00:01:26.202
(panting)

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:28.913
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh! Ow!

00:01:28.996 --> 00:01:30.706
(grunting)

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:31.957
(splutters)

00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:33.209
Gotcha.

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:34.543
(gasps, yells)

00:01:36.587 --> 00:01:38.547
What did I just tell you kids?

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:40.591
(panting)

00:01:44.512 --> 00:01:46.138
Hey. (yelps)

00:01:47.014 --> 00:01:47.973
(grunting)

00:01:48.057 --> 00:01:50.309
(screaming)

00:01:50.392 --> 00:01:52.019
Huh?

00:01:55.773 --> 00:01:56.857
Whoa.

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:00.110
(grunting)

00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:01.570
Whoa. (grunts)

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.322
(panting)

00:02:03.405 --> 00:02:05.282
(screaming)

00:02:06.575 --> 00:02:07.535
(gasps)

00:02:08.035 --> 00:02:08.911
(grunting)

00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:11.789
(echoing mumbling)

00:02:11.872 --> 00:02:14.375
(grunts, yelps)

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.420
(grunting)

00:02:20.005 --> 00:02:22.049
(sighing affectionately)

00:02:22.132 --> 00:02:24.301
(screaming)

00:02:28.764 --> 00:02:31.392
(grunting)

00:02:32.643 --> 00:02:34.645
Ow!

00:02:35.354 --> 00:02:36.772
(gasps)

00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:43.404
(chuckles)

00:02:43.487 --> 00:02:45.072
(panting)

00:02:45.155 --> 00:02:48.576
(sighs)
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:02:48.659 --> 00:02:50.411
Bad egg. Rotten egg.

00:02:50.494 --> 00:02:52.663
A heart attack you almost gave me.

00:02:52.746 --> 00:02:54.290
Oh, I'm sorry, darling.

00:02:54.373 --> 00:02:56.584
It's just that I love you so much.

00:02:56.667 --> 00:02:59.670
Now I want you to meet your
Uncle Manny and your Aunt Ellie.

00:02:59.753 --> 00:03:00.796
Hi.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.464
(high-pitched):
Hello.

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:05.384
I'd like to present
Eggbert, Shelly...

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:06.844
and Yoko.

00:03:06.927 --> 00:03:08.012
MANNY:
Sid?

00:03:08.095 --> 00:03:10.264
Whatever you're doing, it's a bad idea.

00:03:10.347 --> 00:03:11.307
Shh!

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:12.558
My kids'll hear you.

00:03:12.641 --> 00:03:14.560
They're not your kids, Sid.

00:03:14.643 --> 00:03:15.853
Take 'em back.

00:03:15.936 --> 00:03:17.271
You're not meant to be a parent.

00:03:17.354 --> 00:03:18.397
Why not?

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:21.066
First sign: stealing someone else's eggs.

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:24.361
Second sign: one of them
almost became an omelet.

00:03:24.445 --> 00:03:25.905
(grunting)

00:03:25.988 --> 00:03:28.073
ELLIE: Sid, someone's probably
worried sick looking for them.

00:03:28.157 --> 00:03:30.659
No, they were underground, in ice.

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:32.870
If it wasn't for me, they'd be...

00:03:32.953 --> 00:03:34.455
egg-sicles.

00:03:34.538 --> 00:03:36.123
(gasps, sighs)

00:03:36.206 --> 00:03:37.082
MANNY:
Sid,

00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:38.876
I know what
you're going through.

00:03:38.959 --> 00:03:40.920
You're going to have
a family, too, someday.

00:03:41.003 --> 00:03:42.671
You're going to meet a nice girl

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.632
with... with low standards,

00:03:44.715 --> 00:03:47.009
no real options or...

00:03:47.092 --> 00:03:48.093
sense of smell.

00:03:48.177 --> 00:03:49.470
What Manny means to say is--

00:03:49.553 --> 00:03:51.722
No, I get it.
I'll take them back.

00:03:51.805 --> 00:03:52.973
(grunting)

00:03:53.057 --> 00:03:56.143
You have your family,
and I'm better off alone.

00:03:56.226 --> 00:03:57.227
By myself.

00:03:58.687 --> 00:04:00.898
A fortress of solitude.

00:04:02.274 --> 00:04:04.526
In the ice.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:06.737
Forever.

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:09.907
A lone, lonely loner.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.450
That's a lot of aloneness.

00:04:11.533 --> 00:04:13.452
SID:
Precisely!

00:04:13.535 --> 00:04:14.870
Sid, wait!

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:16.664
No, no, it's okay.

00:04:16.747 --> 00:04:17.957
He'll bounce back.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.376
It's one of the advantages of being Sid.

00:04:26.423 --> 00:04:28.425
(thunder rumbling)

00:04:30.719 --> 00:04:33.097
SID:
Why should I take you back?

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:34.807
I love kids.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:39.269
I'm responsible, loving, nurturing.

00:04:39.353 --> 00:04:41.146
What do you think?

00:04:42.272 --> 00:04:44.566
Mmm. I knew you would agree.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.486
(thunder booming)

00:04:47.569 --> 00:04:49.363
Oh, oh, oh, oh, don't cry.

00:04:49.446 --> 00:04:51.156
D-d... don't cry.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:53.033
I-I'll find a dry place.

00:04:54.159 --> 00:04:56.745
(grunting)

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:59.331
Okay. (sighs)
Here, here.

00:04:59.415 --> 00:05:00.708
Let me just dry you off.

00:05:00.791 --> 00:05:03.043
(squeaking)

00:05:03.127 --> 00:05:04.169
(gasps)

00:05:06.171 --> 00:05:07.548
I don't know.

00:05:07.631 --> 00:05:10.134
Being a parent's a lot of work.

00:05:10.217 --> 00:05:12.094
Maybe I'm not ready.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:23.397
♪ ♪

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.492
♪ ♪

00:05:41.749 --> 00:05:43.792
(suspenseful music playing)

00:05:47.087 --> 00:05:48.964
(rustling patter)

00:05:59.558 --> 00:06:01.226
(deep moaning)

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.770
(cracking)

00:06:10.235 --> 00:06:12.738
(gentle snoring and sighing)

00:06:14.448 --> 00:06:15.866
(high-pitched sigh)

00:06:15.949 --> 00:06:18.035
(snorts)

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:19.495
(yawns)

00:06:19.578 --> 00:06:21.455
(smacking lips)

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:28.003
-(bones cracking)
-(sighs)

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:39.098
(yawns)

00:06:39.181 --> 00:06:41.141
(squeaky grunting)

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:47.648
(gasps)

00:06:47.731 --> 00:06:48.857
(purrs)

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:49.900
(squeaky chattering)

00:06:49.983 --> 00:06:51.151
ALL:
Mama!

00:06:51.235 --> 00:06:53.237
-Mama, Mama, Mama, Mama.
-Uh, uh...

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:56.782
-Ma, Ma, Ma...
-(purring)

00:06:57.324 --> 00:06:59.118
I'm a mommy.

00:06:59.201 --> 00:07:01.245
♪ Boom, boom, acka,
lacka, lacka, boom ♪

00:07:01.328 --> 00:07:03.163
-Where's Mommy?
-♪ Boom, boom,acka, lacka, boom, boom ♪

00:07:03.247 --> 00:07:05.290
-(babies cooing)
-♪ Boom, boom, acka, lacka,lacka, boom ♪

00:07:05.374 --> 00:07:07.084
-Here I am.
-♪ Boom, boom,acka, lacka, boom, boom ♪

00:07:07.167 --> 00:07:08.502
(giggling)

00:07:09.711 --> 00:07:12.214
There you go.
Nice squeaky faces.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:15.676
(shrill screaming)

00:07:15.759 --> 00:07:16.760
♪ Open the door ♪

00:07:16.844 --> 00:07:17.970
-(snoring)
-♪ Get on the floor ♪

00:07:18.053 --> 00:07:19.680
-(yawns)
-♪ Everybody walk the dinosaur ♪

00:07:19.763 --> 00:07:21.765
-(yawning)
-♪ Open the door, get on the floor ♪

00:07:21.849 --> 00:07:23.892
♪ Everybody walk the dinosaur ♪

00:07:23.976 --> 00:07:26.019
-(Sid grunting)
-♪ Open the door,get on the floor ♪

00:07:26.103 --> 00:07:28.021
♪ Everybody walk the dinosaur ♪

00:07:28.105 --> 00:07:30.149
-I got it! I got it!
-♪ Open the door,get on the floor ♪

00:07:30.232 --> 00:07:32.151
-(shouts)
-♪ Everybody walk the dinosaur ♪

00:07:32.234 --> 00:07:34.695
-(screaming)
-♪ Boom, boom, acka,lacka, lacka, boom! ♪

00:07:34.778 --> 00:07:37.656
(laughing):
No, no! Stop! Not me! No, stop, stop!

00:07:38.657 --> 00:07:39.950
-(chomping)
-Ow!

00:07:40.033 --> 00:07:40.909
(moaning)

00:07:40.993 --> 00:07:42.953
Hey, no biting.
Uh-uh.

00:07:43.036 --> 00:07:44.288
(whimpering)

00:07:44.371 --> 00:07:46.123
-(crying)
-Oh.

00:07:46.206 --> 00:07:47.332
Oh, oh, I'm sorry.
I'm sorry.

00:07:47.416 --> 00:07:48.959
No, it's okay. It's okay.

00:07:49.042 --> 00:07:50.127
Don't cry.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:51.670
Why-why are you still crying?

00:07:51.753 --> 00:07:52.921
Are you hungry?

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:54.339
Maybe you're hungry.

00:07:54.423 --> 00:07:57.217
I know just the thing.

00:07:57.301 --> 00:07:58.427
(snoring gently)

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.387
SID:
♪ Hush, hush ♪

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:03.140
♪ You mean, vicious animal ♪

00:08:03.223 --> 00:08:05.309
♪ I'm your baby ♪

00:08:05.392 --> 00:08:08.270
♪ And this is my milk ♪

00:08:08.353 --> 00:08:09.605
(surprised grunt)

00:08:09.688 --> 00:08:11.190
(Sid screaming)

00:08:11.273 --> 00:08:13.942
I thought you were a female!

00:08:15.152 --> 00:08:16.904
(high-pitched chittering)

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.744
(panting)

00:08:23.827 --> 00:08:25.162
(gasps)

00:08:25.245 --> 00:08:26.538
(both grunting)

00:08:26.622 --> 00:08:28.457
(echoing thuds)

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.417
(both grunting)

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:31.960
(gurgling)

